---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Guided Workshop with Sue | Knit by Machine";
const description = "A hands-on, personal workshop designed to help you make real progress on a project you’re excited about—at a pace that feels calm and doable.";
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <main class="page page--guided-workshop">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="section section--hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="grid grid--two hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-left">
            <div class="hero-header">
              <div class="hero-title-row">
                <img src="/images/guided_workshops.svg" alt="Guided Workshops logo" class="hero-logo" />
                <h1 data-testid="text-page-title">Guided Workshop with Sue</h1>
              </div>
              <p class="hero-subtitle">
                A 10-day, call-free workshop where you finish one real project on your machine — with calm, written guidance at each step.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-right">
            <!-- You can replace this placeholder with a real image later -->
            <div class="hero-media">
              <div class="placeholder-image">
                <span>Hero Image (Sue + machine setup)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Full-width intro text -->
        <div class="hero-intro-text">
          <p>
            In this guided, one-to-one workshop, we'll choose a realistic project, get your machine behaving, and walk through each step in writing so you're never left wondering what to do next.
          </p>
          <p>
            You set the pace. You check in when you're ready. I reply with clear next steps, adjustments, and encouragement — no calls, no time zones, no pressure to "keep up."
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Centered CTA -->
        <div class="hero-cta hero-cta--centered">
          <a
            class="button button--primary button--large"
            href="https://knitbymachinecom.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=register&planUid=ZmNe52W2&planPaymentTerm=oneTime&skipPlanOptions=true#o-anonymous"
            data-testid="button-cta-hero"
          >
            Start Your Guided Workshop
          </a>
          <p class="hero-note hero-note--full-width">
            Your 10-day window begins when you submit your Project Planner — not at payment. Most knitters check in just a few times during their 10 days. You choose the pace that works for you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- What This Is -->
    <section class="section section--overview">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>What a Guided Workshop Actually Is</h2>
        <p>
          A Guided Workshop is a 10-day, written-support container focused on one finishable project. Instead of a giant course or weekly Zoom calls,
          you get a simple project plan, clear checklists, and private written feedback from Sue whenever you send notes or photos.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you've used <strong>Smart Guides</strong> or <strong>Studio Sessions</strong> before, this is where we apply that knowledge to one real project with focused, one-to-one support.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- Who This Is For -->
    <section class="section section--problem">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>If your machine has been sitting quietly…</h2>
        <p>
          …and you're not sure what to knit next — or how to start without "messing it up" — a Guided Workshop gives you a calm, realistic path forward.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid--two">
          <div>
            <h3>Perfect if you're:</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>A newer or rusty knitter who wants help choosing a project that fits your current skills and time.</li>
              <li>Returning to your machine after a break and craving a clear, do-able plan.</li>
              <li>Busy, juggling real life, and needing support that works without live calls or complicated scheduling.</li>
              <li>Someone who learns best from written steps, photos, and checklists you can revisit.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Not the best fit if you're:</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Looking for weekly group calls or live Zoom coaching.</li>
              <li>Wanting a big video course to binge-watch rather than a focused project.</li>
              <li>Unable to work within a 10-day window or send occasional notes/photos of your progress.</li>
              <li>More interested in collecting information than finishing one real, finishable project.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- How the 10 Days Work -->
    <section class="section section--how-it-works">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>How Your 10-Day Guided Workshop Works</h2>
        <ol class="steps-list">
          <li>
            <h3>1. Join the workshop.</h3>
            <p>
              You'll complete checkout and get immediate access to your Project Planner — a simple intake form where you'll share your machine, yarn,
              and the project you'd like to work on.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>2. Choose when to begin.</h3>
            <p>
              Your 10 days do <strong>not</strong> start at payment. They begin when you submit your Project Planner. Start today, next week, or when
              your yarn arrives — you're in control.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>3. Tell Sue about your project.</h3>
            <p>
              Use the Project Planner to describe what you want to finish (or finally start), your time constraints, and any parts that feel confusing
              or scary.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>4. Get your personalized plan.</h3>
            <p>
              I review your intake and send a clear, realistic plan for your 10 days: simple steps, machine checks, and small milestones that fit the
              time and energy you actually have.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>5. Move forward at your pace.</h3>
            <p>
              You check in when you're ready — with notes, questions, or photos of what you're seeing on the machine. I reply with adjustments,
              explanations, and your next step. Most knitters check in just a handful of times during their 10 days.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="callout callout--contrast">
          <p>
            No calls. No camera. No time zones to juggle. Just written, private guidance that meets you where you are — and moves you steadily toward a
            finished project.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- Example Projects -->
    <section class="section section--examples">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Good Projects for a Guided Workshop</h2>
        <p>Here are some examples of projects that work especially well inside a 10-day container:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your first simple baby blanket or throw on a newly revived machine.</li>
          <li>A straightforward scarf or shawl that lets you practice clean cast-ons and tidy edges.</li>
          <li>A hat or set of hats to get comfortable with shaping and finishing.</li>
          <li>Finishing a stalled sweater where you're stuck on shaping, sizing, or assembly.</li>
          <li>A basic sweater or cardigan using yarn you already love, where fit and measurements really matter.</li>
          <li>Reviving an older machine with a simple "test project" that builds confidence and familiarity.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          If you're unsure whether your idea fits, you can describe it in your Project Planner and we'll shape it into a calm, finishable project
          together.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- Pricing / Levels -->
    <section class="section section--pricing" id="pricing">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Choose Your Workshop Level</h2>
        <p>
          Both options are 10-day, call-free workshops with written guidance and a personalized project plan. Choose the level that matches the size and
          complexity of the project you have in mind.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Quick chooser:</strong> Choose <em>Core</em> for smaller/simpler projects; choose <em>Plus</em> for sweaters or projects with more shaping and moving pieces.</p>

        <div class="grid grid--two pricing-grid">
          <div class="card card--pricing" data-testid="card-pricing-core">
            <h3>Workshop Core — $297</h3>
            <p>
              Perfect for smaller, simpler projects—like scarves, hats, blankets
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Personalized 10-Day Finish Plan</li>
              <li>Step-by-step guidance</li>
              <li>Machine Quick Cards</li>
              <li>Diagnostics + checklists</li>
              <li><strong>Private written feedback during your 10 days</strong><br>
              Check in with notes or photos and get calm, personalized guidance.
              </li>
              <li><strong>Call-free guidance</strong><br>
              Works in any time zone — no meetings or scheduling needed.
              </li>
            </ul>
           <a 
  class="button button--primary" 
  href="https://knitbymachinecom.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=register&planUid=ZmNe52W2&planPaymentTerm=oneTime&skipPlanOptions=true#o-anonymous"
  data-testid="button-cta-hero"
>
  Workshop Core
</a>
          <div class="pricing-helper">
            <a href="#" data-modal-open="is-this-for-you">
              Is this guided workshop right for you?
            </a>
          </div>

          </div>
          <div class="card card--pricing card--featured" data-testid="card-pricing-plus">
            <div class="featured-badge">Most Popular</div>
            <h3>Workshop Plus — $497</h3>
            <p>
              Best for sweaters, multi-piece garments, or more complex projects where extra support and shaping decisions really matter.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Everything in Workshop Core</li>
              <li><strong>More feedback when you need it</strong><br>
              Extra written support throughout your 10 days.
              </li>
              <li><strong>Extra support for bigger projects</strong><br>
              Space for shaping decisions, fit questions, and more moving pieces.
              </li>
              <li><strong>Call-free guidance</strong><br>
              Works in any time zone — no meetings or scheduling needed.
              </li>
            </ul>
<a 
  class="button button--primary" 
  href="https://knitbymachinecom.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=register&planUid=ZmNe52W2&planPaymentTerm=oneTime&skipPlanOptions=true#o-anonymous"
  data-testid="button-cta-hero"
>
  Workshop Plus
</a>
          <div class="pricing-helper">
            <a href="#" data-modal-open="is-this-for-you">
              Is this guided workshop right for you?
            </a>
          </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- Guarantee -->
    <section class="section section--guarantee">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>The First Steps Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          Follow the first steps in your plan and send your initial progress. If you feel the workshop isn't a good fit during your 10-day window, email me and I'll refund your registration.
        </p>
        <p class="guarantee-note">No drama. No hoops.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="section section--cta">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--center">
        <h2>Ready to Begin?</h2>
        <p>
          Start with the Project Planner. Tell me what you want to knit — and I'll
          create a calm, finishable path forward.
        </p>
<a 
  class="button button--primary" 
  href="https://knitbymachinecom.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=register&planUid=ZmNe52W2&planPaymentTerm=oneTime&skipPlanOptions=true#o-anonymous"
  data-testid="button-cta-hero"
>
  Start Your Guided Workshop
</a>

        <div class="how-it-works-link">
          <a href="#" data-modal-open="how-it-works">How does this workshop work?</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- Is This For You Modal -->
  <div id="is-this-for-you-modal" class="modal hidden">
    <div class="modal-overlay" data-modal-close="is-this-for-you"></div>
    <div class="modal-content">
      <button class="modal-close" data-modal-close="is-this-for-you">×</button>
      <h2>Is a guided workshop right for you?</h2>
      <div class="modal-fit-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>This is for you if…</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Your machine has been sitting quietly and you're ready to use it again.</li>
            <li>You want a realistic 10-day container with calm, written guidance.</li>
            <li>You prefer clear steps and check-ins over long live calls.</li>
            <li>You're willing to take small actions and send quick updates.</li>
            <li>You want knitting to feel doable and encouraging, not overwhelming.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>This is not for you if…</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>You want weekly group calls or live Zoom coaching.</li>
            <li>You're looking for a big video course you can binge.</li>
            <li>You don't want to work within a 10-day window.</li>
            <li>You're not able to send occasional notes or photos of your progress.</li>
            <li>You'd rather collect information than focus on one finishable project.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- How It Works Modal -->
  <div id="how-it-works-modal" class="modal hidden">
    <div class="modal-overlay" data-modal-close="how-it-works"></div>
    <div class="modal-content">
      <button class="modal-close" data-modal-close="how-it-works">×</button>
      <h2>How Your Guided Workshop Works</h2>

      <ol class="modal-steps">
        <li><strong>Join the workshop.</strong> You'll complete checkout and get immediate access to your Project Planner (intake form).</li>
        <li><strong>Choose when to begin.</strong> Your 10 days do NOT start at payment. They begin when you submit your Project Planner—so you can start today, tomorrow, or whenever you're ready.</li>
        <li><strong>Tell Sue about your project.</strong> Use the Project Planner to share what you want to finish (or begin) and where you need support.</li>
        <li><strong>Get your first step.</strong> Sue reviews your intake and sends your personalized starting point.</li>
        <li><strong>Move forward at your pace.</strong> Check in when you're ready. Sue responds with your next steps—no calls, no pressure, no overwhelm.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="modal-note">
  I typically reply within one business day, Monday–Friday (Pacific time).
</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page--guided-workshop {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .section-inner--center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Hero Section */
  .section--hero {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-logo {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .hero-logo {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
    }
  }

  .section--hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    color: var(--kbm-green-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .hero-media {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-note {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #5a6b47;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Full-width intro text below hero grid */
  .hero-intro-text {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero-intro-text p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Centered CTA */
  .hero-cta--centered {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-note--full-width {
    max-width: 100%;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Section CTA */
  .section-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Placeholder Images */
  .placeholder-image {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e9ece7 0%, #d4dbc8 100%);
    border: 2px dashed var(--kbm-green-2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 200px;
  }

  .placeholder-image span {
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .placeholder-image--portrait {
    min-height: 300px;
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .button--primary {
    background-color: var(--kbm-green);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: var(--kbm-green);
  }

  .button--primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--kbm-green-hover, #445626);
    border-color: var(--kbm-green-hover, #445626);
  }

  .button--secondary {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    border-color: var(--kbm-green);
  }

  .button--secondary:hover {
    background-color: var(--kbm-green);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .button--large {
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  /* Section Headings */
  .section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .section h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .section p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Lists */
  .section ul,
  .section ol {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .section li {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.05rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Grid Layout */
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .grid--two {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .grid--two {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Callout Box */
  .callout {
    background: #f9fdf5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .callout--contrast {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--kbm-green-2);
  }

  .callout p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Steps List */
  .steps-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .steps-list li {
    background: #f9fdf5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--kbm-green-2);
  }

  .steps-list h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .steps-list p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Included List */
  .included-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .included-list li {
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e8e0;
  }

  .included-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* Pricing Cards */
  .pricing-grid {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card--pricing {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e8e0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .card--featured {
    border: 2px solid var(--kbm-green);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(82, 104, 45, 0.15);
  }

  .featured-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--kbm-green);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .card--pricing h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card--pricing .button {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Guarantee Section */
  .section--guarantee {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section--guarantee .section-inner {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .guarantee-note {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* About Section */
  .about-grid {
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-content {
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* Media Elements */
  .media {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  /* Divider */
  .kbm-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e8e0;
    margin: 3rem auto;
  }

  /* Problem Section Styling */
  .section--problem {
    background-color: #F7F9F3;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .fit-icon {
    margin-right: 6px;
    color: #C2614E;
  }

  .section--problem h3 .fa-check {
    color: #6E8B3D;
  }

  /* Overview Cards */
  .workshop-overview-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .workshop-overview-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .workshop-card {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .workshop-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .workshop-card ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .workshop-card li + li {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* Final CTA */
  .section--cta {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9fdf5 0%, #e9ece7 100%);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .section--cta h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section--cta p {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Responsive Adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page--guided-workshop {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .hero-logo {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
    }

    .card--pricing {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .section--cta {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  /* How It Works Modal Link */
  .how-it-works-link {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
